    <rdfs:label>2-[(3R,6aS,8R,10aS)-3-hydroxy-1-(1-oxopropyl)-3,4,6,6a,8,9,10,10a-octahydro-2H-pyrano[2,3-c][1,5]oxazocin-8-yl]-N-[(3,5-difluorophenyl)methyl]acetamide</rdfs:label>
